<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 5,080 tonnes U.S. wheat for Kenya.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 5,080 tonnes U.S. wheat for Kenya.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on June 17 for up to 5,080 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for export to Kenya.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for July 1-25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
